    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d7f963cf00c6b6c6ae8775</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Sep 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期朋友：</span></strong><span>Erica</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:00:49</a> 毕业专业是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">00:01:05</a> 怎么接触并进入人工智能领域？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">00:02:58</a> 应届生的薪资起点幅度是多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">00:04:18</a> AIGC创意研发岗日常工作内容是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">00:08:39</a> AI应用中会出现知识产权纠纷吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">00:14:19</a> 使用AIGC设计的进入门槛有多高？享用AI的优势只是龙头和大资本吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">00:17:46</a> AI产生了自我意识，其领域的从事人员面临怎么样的处境？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">00:19:51</a> AI在实际生活有什么影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1401">00:23:21</a> AI会取代画师或设计师这样的岗位吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">00:26:38</a> AI工具的成本与人工对比？应聘人员该如何突显作品集？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">00:31:31</a> 怎么获得高校讲师的机会？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">00:36:27</a> 高校讲师会逐步趋向年轻化吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">00:38:52</a> 为什么学院会增设AI课程？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2392">00:39:52</a> AI创意研发岗/高校讲师分别有什么神奇？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>各类对谈嘉宾持续开放~</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>想参与播客录制的各位请移步</span><strong><span>【节目公告】</span></strong><span>与</span><strong><span>【节目详情】</span></strong><span>，请勇敢告诉我，你骨子里的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>全能播客创作者正是在下，选题/拟稿/录制/剪辑一手包揽。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
